{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：绿城服务1H26核心利润增12%，全年中双位数增长可期</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">绿城服务交出了一份温和<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>的半年报。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>在最新研报中指出，公司1H26核心净利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12%</span>，略高于其预测值<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>；核心经营利润（毛利减销售管理费用）同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，同样超出预期<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>。在物业管理行业普遍调整的背景下，这份成绩单的成色主要来自成本控制和利润率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>，而非收入端的强劲增长。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看收入结构。上半年总收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，其中物业管理收入增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>，咨询服务和社区增值服务分别持平于下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>。社区增值服务的下滑影响了整体收入表现，但公司通过提升毛利率和压缩费用率，把利润增速做到了收入增速的两倍以上。物业管理毛利率同比提升0.7个百分点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，整体毛利率提升0.5个百分点至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20%</span>，销售管理费用占收入比重从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.7%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.1%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份研报最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的判断是：全年中双位数增长基本可以锁定。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>预计全年核心经营利润和核心净利润分别增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>，而公司股权激励设定的业绩目标隐含的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>核心经营利润只需比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY23</span>高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">60%</span>，即同比约5%的增长。上半年已经实现了15%的同比增长，这意味着即便下半年出现10%的下滑，全年目标也能达成。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVOXucDGxBtMjqsrf7gtf1bicNDdRB0aodwKmHQCOGbB9VfhfiboQoicxABlBGRc9pDAtYm0nclfwwkm1iaRnuBaEjKr76PicTFMwNM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 利润增长靠费用控制而非收入<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把上半年数据拆开看，收入端其实并不出彩。总收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，社区增值服务收入同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>，咨询业务基本持平。真正拉动利润的是两个变量：毛利率提升和费用率下降。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">物业管理毛利率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.3%</span>提升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16.0%</span>，社区增值服务毛利率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26.8%</span>提升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28.6%</span>，整体毛利率达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">20.0%</span>。与此同时，销售费用同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，管理费用基本持平，销售管理费用率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.7%</span>降至7.1%。一升一降之间，核心经营利润率从11.6%提升至12.7%。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看毛利率和费用率这两个数字的变动方向，它们比收入增速更能说明经营质量。简单说，收入增长节奏变化时利润还能保持双位数增长，靠的是内部管理效率而非市场<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>；后续更值得观察的是这种费用控制能力能否在收入增速进一步节奏变化到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>以下时依然维持。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX7EuUricAibbuXoLEXHx0tAzG3HBb4P37nnJiaItuP413mmnMsfHD2HcSQZ0GpD0jI3NmiceA4dYXdMUia1eYiboZheMFXCC9g4kq7k/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 股权激励目标设定留出充足安全垫</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">公司管理层通过股权激励设定的业绩目标，实际上为全年业绩提供了可量化的底线。目标隐含的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>核心经营利润需要比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY23</span>高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">60%</span>，换算成同比增速约为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>。上半年已经完成了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15%</span>的同比增长，距离全年目标只差一步。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>测算，即便下半年核心经营利润同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">10%</span>，全年仍能达到激励目标。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>市场对全年业绩的担忧更多集中在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>之后，而非当下。研报预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY27</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY28</span>的利润增速将回落至高个位数，原因是新项目<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>节奏变化以及基数抬升。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里更值得关注的是公司对<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>增长的指引逻辑。收入增速预计从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY26</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.9%</span>降至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">FY27</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.7%</span>，但利润率仍在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，EBITDA利润率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">9.4%</span>提升至10.0%。利润增长从“收入驱动”切换为“利润率驱动”，这种切换能否持续，取决于成本控制是否还有空间。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVicbk2XBGc9Y4nET2YLXREX6TLBwryDlcRnSqmR4xOZ4Rk1kuOZGe7uuBiaQkvUju1auemnJwYLqQibO8ZevibZknIMibQzhiad1fpE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV5n46aJZicGClF6CKsoSiapSHicsicdLhtbjudiayealiaHnGRpicLIhpLWcxoYktlLtWeta5GBAt7knWJefoP4wFhiaJTkNwVgAkUHGM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 20-JPM-Greentown Service-2869.HK-1H26 earnings a mild beat- on track to deliver-260823</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
